## VM arguments for squidward_chat releases.
## Set the corresponding OS environment variables before starting the release.
##
## Variable       │ Default            │ Notes
## ───────────────┼────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────
## RELEASE_NODE   │ squidward_chat@127.0.0.1 │ Erlang node name
## RELEASE_COOKIE │ (auto-generated)   │ Distribution cookie; set for stable remsh

-name ${RELEASE_NODE}
-setcookie ${RELEASE_COOKIE}

## Recommended production flags
+K true
+A 8
